      "description": "The last episode: 16:9 art scrimmed into the card, brown play circle on the art's edge, title, lines, progress.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-resume\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"ds-resume-art\"><button class=\"ds-play\" aria-label=\"Play\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\" fill=\"#000\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"ds-resume-body\"><div class=\"ds-resume-title\">BOFURI</div><div class=\"ds-dim\">Episode 7</div><div class=\"ds-dim\">10 min left · 59% easy</div><div class=\"ds-bar\"><span style=\"width:60%\"></span></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-resume{font-family: Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif;width:360px;background:#2A2734;border-radius:16px;color:#F2F0F7}.ds-resume-art{position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:16px 16px 0 0;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 45%,#2A2734 100%),linear-gradient(135deg,#4A6FA8,#4E7A50)}.ds-play{position:absolute;right:16px;bottom:-32px;width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;border:none;background:#C98A4B;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer}.ds-play:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}.ds-play:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #F2F0F7;outline-offset:2px}.ds-resume-body{padding:0 16px 16px}.ds-resume-title{font-size:22px;line-height:28px;padding-right:72px}.ds-dim{color:#A9A4B8;font-size:14px;line-height:20px}.ds-bar{height:4px;margin-top:12px;background:#1D1B26;border-radius:2px}.ds-bar span{display:block;height:100%;background:#C98A4B;border-radius:2px}"
